+#
+# Critical phase: the actor acts until the first object is held (see
+# LiberoEnv._init_rlt_policy_switch); SmolVLA then finishes the task. Both env.train and
+# env.eval run the normal LIBERO episode ("full_task"); the only reward is task
+# completion. Because the phase ends long before the reward arrives,
+# algorithm.rlt_phase_return gives the last transition of the phase the reward collected
+# after it and marks it terminal. (mode: grasp_subtask instead ends the episode with
+# reward 1 at the first grasp; use it with rlt_phase_return: False.)
